TRACE_DROP_COVERED_TODO_DET	To do: nothing. The next run shows whether the block holds.
TRACE_DROP_BLOCK_LEAK_YEL	Block not effective: blocked address(es) still reach the appliance after the block date:
TRACE_DROP_BLOCK_LEAK_DET	%1: %2, but %3 request(s) in the window, the last on %4
